public static class FinishRoleTextures {public static object Main(){if(EditorApplication.isPlayingOrWillChangePlaymode)throw new Exception("Edit required");const string root="Assets/ShooterSurvival/Models/Chapters/Chapters45/DetailedCharacters20261003/",backup="outputs/chapter45-detailed-design-2026-10-03/recovery/role-texture-mips";if(Directory.Exists(backup))throw new Exception("Already applied");Directory.CreateDirectory(backup);var rows=new List<object>();foreach(var id in new[]{"CH01","CH02","CH03","CH04R","CH05","CH06R","CH07","CH08","CH09","CH10"}){var mat=AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<Material>(root+id+"/character.mat");string path=AssetDatabase.GetAssetPath(mat.GetTexture("_BaseMap"));File.Copy(path+".meta",backup+"/"+id+".meta",false);var ti=(TextureImporter)AssetImporter.GetAtPath(path);ti.mipmapEnabled=false;ti.maxTextureSize=2048;ti.textureCompression=TextureImporterCompression.CompressedHQ;ti.filterMode=FilterMode.Bilinear;ti.SetPlatformTextureSettings(new TextureImporterPlatformSettings{name="Android",overridden=true,maxTextureSize=2048,format=TextureImporterFormat.ASTC_4x4,compressionQuality=100});ti.SaveAndReimport();var tex=AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<Texture2D>(path);rows.Add(new{id,path,tex.width,tex.height,tex.mipmapCount,format=tex.format.ToString(),android="ASTC4x4 2048 no mip; shared per model",memory=UnityEngine.Profiling.Profiler.GetRuntimeMemorySizeLong(tex)});}return new{items=rows,reason="Native controlled tests: mip-only reproduces seams; compression-only clean. Preserve original atlas and isolate no-mip setting to these 10 models."};}}
